, "Top-right — \"HAIR LIGHT\": Backlight positioned high and slightly behind, illuminating only the hair edges with a luminous golden halo effect. Translucent glowing strands at the crown and tips, creating a dreamy soft radiance around her head. Face softly lit from the front with a gentle key light, warm and ethereal mood.", "Bottom-left — \"SOFT FOCUS FILTER\": Shot through a diffusion/soft-focus lens filter. Highlights bloom and bleed softly, skin appears porcelain-smooth with a hazy glow, specular highlights on hair become misty halos. Overall image has a filmy, dreamy, vintage cinematic quality with reduced contrast and lifted shadows.", "Bottom-right — \"SHALLOW DOF\": Ultra-shallow depth of field (f/1.2), razor-sharp focus on her eyes only, foreground hair strands melting into creamy bokeh, background completely dissolved into smooth circular bokeh balls. Subject pops dramatically from the blurred environment, layered and three-dimensional.", ""], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "optional_prompt_list", "label": "optional_prompt_list", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "optional_prompt_list"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_1"}, "name": "prompt_1", "label": "prompt_1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_2"}, "name": "prompt_2", "label": "prompt_2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_3"}, "name": "prompt_3", "label": "prompt_3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_3"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_4"}, "name": "prompt_4", "label": "prompt_4", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_4"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_5"}, "name": "prompt_5", "label": "prompt_5", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_5"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "easy promptList", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [240, 324], "pos": [0, 702], "id": 54, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptList"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#27364a